## Available Scripts

You can execute these scripts when needed:

- `.\scripts\check-environment.ps1` - Verify all services running
- `.\scripts\start-session.ps1` - Start session with environment check
- `.\scripts\update-task.ps1` - Update task status in PROJECT_MASTER.md
- `.\scripts\new-session.ps1` - Create new session file
- `.\scripts\end-session.ps1` - End session procedure (update, commit, summarize)
- `.\scripts\review-code.ps1` - Comprehensive code review before PR
- `.\scripts\create-pr.ps1` - Create pull request with description

